*            typed in lower case stops producing two spurious prompts
*            (PRE_RELEASE_FIXES.md 26, UPSTREAM 27).  New message 10117.
* 19 Aug 26 Windows port - the F/Q file-pointer VOC ids are lower case:
*            voc, newvoc, accounts, messages, syscom, qfile, dict.dict, md,
